### Lahloba API Test Requests (VS Code REST Client)
### Install "humao.rest-client" extension

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/v1
@token = {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Request OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/otp/request
Content-Type: application/json

{"phone": "+201000000001"}

### Verify OTP (bypass)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/otp/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{"phone": "+201000000001", "code": "000000"}

### List Meals
GET {{baseUrl}}/meals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Meal Detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/meals/meal_001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search Meals
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=chicken
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Compute Ingredient Combos
POST {{baseUrl}}/ingredient-combos/compute
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"meal_id": "meal_001", "servings": 2, "address_id": "addr_001"}

### Create Order
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"meal_id": "meal_001", "servings": 2, "ingredient_source": "STORES", "address_id": "addr_001"}

### List Orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/intent
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"order_id": "ord_REPLACE", "method": "CARD", "amount_minor": 28000}

### Add Favorite
POST {{baseUrl}}/favorites/meal_001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Loyalty Account
GET {{baseUrl}}/loyalty/account
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Earn Loyalty Points
POST {{baseUrl}}/loyalty/earn/order
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"order_id": "ord_REPLACE", "total_minor": 28000}

### ETA Prediction
POST {{baseUrl}}/eta/predict
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"order_id": "ord_REPLACE", "task_type": "MEAL_RUN", "distance_km": 5, "stop_count": 2}

### Analytics Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Outbox Events
GET {{baseUrl}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
